Mistral-7B & RoBERTa-MNLI & PW-600 & $+$1.42 & $+$4.17 \\
\addlinespace
Qwen2.5-14B & DeBERTa-MNLI & PW-600 & $-$0.21 & $+$0.33 \\
Mistral-7B & DeBERTa-MNLI & FOLIO-204 & $-$0.47 & $+$2.94 \\
\addlinespace
